{"data": [{"id": "2122118751793340609", "author_id": "1886544012917800961", "text": "@kimmonismus And the gap is the wild part. On Scale's board Fable 5.2 is at 41.25, next are Opus 5.5 at 21.25 and GPT-6 Astra at 20.83. It's still weak at product design and animation though, so the hit to white collar work will be very uneven.", "created_at": "2026-11-16T00:05:12.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Andy09131042701/status/2122118751793340609", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122115073401667654", "author_id": "1826745977891430400", "text": "@kimmonismus 2.5% to 41.3% in 13 months is wild. The more telling number is the other 58.7%. Are those failing on the hard technical bits, or on figuring out what the client actually wanted?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:50:35.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/TechTvCh/status/2122115073401667654", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122108653385728488", "author_id": "1869956772284207104", "text": "@SpacemanLMD @scottsantens @kimmonismus https://t.co/yg6crY2qb2", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:25:04.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/brokk07/status/2122108653385728488", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122105179873194180", "author_id": "71419057", "text": "@kimmonismus Forget 2027. These were paid 29-hour projects — at 41% done, the price of that work is already collapsing. Completion rate understates the economics.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T23:11:16.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/vpodugu/status/2122105179873194180", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122096772394934555", "author_id": "1158472312267649025", "text": "@scottsantens @kimmonismus I really thought after 2020 and Yang ubi would have been more mainstream. But nobody seems to talk about it much anymore.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T22:37:51.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/guildelin/status/2122096772394934555", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122082494224748990", "author_id": "1426229853410545665", "text": "@scottsantens @kimmonismus How much do I get vs you? It's subjective to everyone. Someone would take $5K, but I'd need $15K a month. Doesn't work in my opinion.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T21:41:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/father_simple/status/2122082494224748990", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122072427794706732", "author_id": "748983000331870208", "text": "@brokk07 @scottsantens @kimmonismus Plenty of smart people will have to figure it out.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T21:01:07.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SpacemanLMD/status/2122072427794706732", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122064055963668909", "author_id": "1763340678572998656", "text": "@kimmonismus The number I'd watch is the 58.7% it still can't finish.\n\nThat's where the job is moving: scoping a messy brief, catching what the client didn't say, owning the result when it goes wrong.\n\nIf your work is all execution, start building the judgment part now.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:27:51.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/colepirelli/status/2122064055963668909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122062021554582009", "author_id": "1869956772284207104", "text": "@SpacemanLMD @scottsantens @kimmonismus How are you going to pay for it with no money?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:19:46.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/brokk07/status/2122062021554582009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122061474109764045", "author_id": "748983000331870208", "text": "@brokk07 @scottsantens @kimmonismus Won't somebody please think about the money. Forget the money and start to think about how we're all going to survive when 90% of the current jobs are taken by AI.  Don't wait to long to think about it...", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:17:36.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/SpacemanLMD/status/2122061474109764045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122059460344525284", "author_id": "2020495762019536896", "text": "@kimmonismus From 2.5% to 41.3% in 13 months — that acceleration is unreal 🤯", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:09:35.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/fufeng1688/status/2122059460344525284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122057102390911215", "author_id": "1566271307251011584", "text": "@kimmonismus The part I'd look at is the 59% it still fails. On 29-hour paid jobs, a half-finished deliverable is worth roughly zero to the client, so the jump only matters if failures get caught early instead of at handoff. Still, 2.5% to 41% in 13 months is not a number you can ignore.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T20:00:13.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/XiangLi1986/status/2122057102390911215", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122055461218238957", "author_id": "2459846702", "text": "@scottsantens The ideal proof-of-unique-human may be what BitNation came up with via me, implemented since 8 years - Gavin Wood who built Ethereum (a serious person) currently promoting a copy of it, with worse design but same concept I invented. \"Proof-of-humanity\" never seemed serious, at", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:53:42.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/resilience_me/status/2122055461218238957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122054619916591513", "author_id": "1869956772284207104", "text": "@scottsantens @kimmonismus We have a $40 trillion debt. With what money?", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:50:21.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/brokk07/status/2122054619916591513", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 56, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}}, {"id": "2122053098017595438", "author_id": "2043685291265851392", "text": "@kimmonismus The jump is wild, but the 58.7% that still fails is the interesting part. Which kinds of projects are those? That's where human work is heading.", "created_at": "2026-11-15T19:44:19.000Z", "url": "https://x.com/Dave_Joe_9377/status/2122053098017595438", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1886544012917800961", "username": "Andy09131042701", "name": "Andy", "verified": false}, {"id": "1573399256836309009", "username": "kimmonismus", "name": "Chubby♨️", "verified": false}, {"id": "1826745977891430400", "username": "TechTvCh", "name": "Tech TV Channel", "verified": false}, {"id": "1869956772284207104", "username": "brokk07", "name": "Brokk", "verified": false}, {"id": "748983000331870208", "username": "SpacemanLMD", "name": "Liam Durrant", "verified": false}, {"id": "14297863", "username": "scottsantens", "name": "Scott Santens", "verified": false}, {"id": "71419057", "username": "vpodugu", "name": "venkatq3", "verified": false}, {"id": "1158472312267649025", "username": "guildelin", "name": "Guildelin", "verified": false}, {"id": "1426229853410545665", "username": "father_simple", "name": "Hardcore Raven", "verified": false}, {"id": "1763340678572998656", "username": "colepirelli", "name": "Cole Pirelli", "verified": false}, {"id": "2020495762019536896", "username": "fufeng1688", "name": "🍎课代表", "verified": false}, {"id": "1566271307251011584", "username": "XiangLi1986", "name": "Xiang Li", "verified": false}, {"id": "2459846702", "username": "resilience_me", "name": "Johan Nygren", "verified": false}, {"id": "2043685291265851392", "username": "Dave_Joe_9377", "name": "🇰🇷Dave_Joe_9377🇦🇺", "verified": false}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2122118751793340609", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzow692r2bp25a9bkqu5hq0bputtp", "oldest_id": "2122053098017595438", "result_count": 15}}